      "size": [
        420,
        300
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 0,
      "mode": 0,
      "title": "START HERE",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "RETAKE - redo part of a clip you already rendered\n\nLoad the finished mp4, set the window, write a prompt for that moment. Everything outside the window is frozen exactly as it was; only the window is painted again.\n\nmode:\n  video + audio - redo the moment completely.\n  video only - keep the performance. The voice, the timing and the room tone are untouched, so the fixed clip still cuts against the rest.\n  audio only - keep the picture and change the line. Lip movement is whatever was rendered, so write the new line about as long as the old one.\n\nThe window snaps to the latent grid (8 frames, a third of a second at 24 fps). Under about a second there is not enough room for it to come out different.\n\nUse the SAME model, LoRAs and VAEs the clip was rendered with - the frozen material is raw latents from that model, and a different one will not match at the seam."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
